{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19091","headline":"送慧则法师归上都因呈广宣上人 · 刘禹锡","name":"送慧则法师归上都因呈广宣上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日东林看讲时，都人象马蹋琉璃。\n雪山童子应前世，金粟如来是本师。\n一锡言归九城路，三衣曾拂万年枝。\n休公久别如相问，楚客逢秋心更悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19091.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19091","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}